NOTICE
======

This file records the copyright and license statements found in this
repository, and the paths each one covers.

The repository's own license is MIT, in `LICENSE`. Some files in this tree
carry a different license statement, and some carry none. This file reports
what those files declare, as text. It draws no conclusions beyond that.

Entries below were produced by reading every tracked file in the tree, other
than the two files added by the change that introduced this file (`NOTICE`
and `LICENSE-APACHE-2.0`). That is 155 files.


